  <changelog date="2025-02-03">
    <element>mod_uk_switcher</element>
    <type>module</type>
    <version>2.5</version>
    <addition>
      <item><![CDATA[Module class suffix applied to layout wrapper (mod_uk_switcher + suffix)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[README.md and COMPLIANCE_REPORT.md added]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Empty index.html in each folder for security (directory listing prevention)]]></item>
    </addition>
    <change>
      <item><![CDATA[Version set to 2.5, creation date updated]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Changelog restructured]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Folder structure aligned with Joomla core: &quot;languages&quot; renamed to &quot;language&quot;, language files to mod_uk_switcher.ini / mod_uk_switcher.sys.ini (no en-GB. prefix)]]></item>
    </change>
    <remove>
      <item><![CDATA[**Typ:** Yes/No Radio Button]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Funktion:** Aktiviert die CSS-Klasse `uk-card-hover` auf dem Karten-DIV]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Effekt:** Karte hebt sich beim Hover um 10px nach oben]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**CSS:**<br />  ```css<br />  .uk-card-hover {<br />    transition: all 0.5s ease !important;<br />  }<br />  .uk-card-hover:hover {<br />    transform: translateY(-10px);<br />  }<br />  ```]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Typ:** Yes/No Radio Button]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Funktion:** Aktiviert die CSS-Klasse `img-hover` auf Bildern]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Effekt:** Bild wird beim Hover dunkler (Brightness 0.5)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**CSS:**<br />  ```css<br />  .img-hover { <br />    transition: filter 0.5s <br />  }<br />  .img-hover:hover { <br />    filter: brightness(0.5); <br />  }<br />  ```]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Typ:** Textfeld]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Funktion:** Fügt beliebige CSS-Klassen als Suffix hinzu]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Beispiel:** `my-custom-class another-class`]]></item>
    </remove>
    <note>
      <item><![CDATA[#### 1. **Card Animation**]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[#### 2. **Image Animation**]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[#### 3. **Card Class**]]></item>
    </note>
